00000000  04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000010  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
*
00000060  U0 U1 U2 U3 BC 00 00 00  00 00                    |..........|
0000006a

# UID bytes masked (U0-U3) - it is a real transit card. BC = BCC checksum
# byte, verified on the original: U0^U1^U2^U3 == BC. Byte 0 read 0x04, data
# area all zero: a transit card is not an NTAG, so there is no NDEF payload.
